{"seq":3,"slug":"infrastructure","title":"基础设施","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/infrastructure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"batch-async-patterns","title":"批处理与异步模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/infrastructure/batch-async-patterns","wordCount":1263,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"self-hosted-vs-api","title":"自建推理 vs API 采购","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/infrastructure/self-hosted-vs-api","wordCount":2307,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"quantization-distillation-cost","title":"量化与蒸馏的成本收益","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-cost-token-optimization/infrastructure/quantization-distillation-cost","wordCount":1982,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础设施-简介\">基础设施 简介</h1><p>优化策略解决&quot;同样的事怎么花得少&quot;，基础设施层解决&quot;这件事是否该用这种方式做&quot;。架构选型的决策影响是策略层优化的数倍——选错了部署模式，再精巧的路由和缓存也无法弥补结构性浪费。</p>\n<p>本章三篇文档覆盖三个基础设施层面的成本决策。</p>\n<p><strong>批处理与异步模式</strong>利用时间换成本。OpenAI Batch API 提供全模型 50% 折扣，Anthropic 的 Message Batches 提供类似优惠——代价仅仅是 24 小时内返回结果而非实时响应。队列化架构、优先级分层、异步回调模式，让非实时场景（评估、摘要生成、数据标注、内容审核）以半价运行。</p>\n<p><strong>自建推理 vs API 采购</strong>是一个 TCO 问题而非技术偏好。当月调用量超过某个阈值时，自建推理集群的摊销成本低于按量付费。但 GPU 采购/租赁、运维团队、模型更新、弹性伸缩的隐性成本经常被低估。混合架构（基线流量自建 + 峰值溢出到 API）正成为大规模部署的标准答案。</p>\n<p><strong>量化与蒸馏的成本收益</strong>用模型工程手段降低推理单价。INT4/INT8 量化让同一硬件承载 2-4 倍吞吐；知识蒸馏把大模型能力压缩进小模型，配合路由系统减少对昂贵旗舰的依赖。RouteNLP 的研究表明，针对性蒸馏（针对路由升级失败的 case）比无差别蒸馏的成本收益高 2 倍以上。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>决策提示</strong>：大多数中小团队（月支出 &lt; <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>K</mi><mtext>）不需要自建推理——优先用好</mtext><mi>B</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>I</mi><mtext>和路由策略。月支出超过</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10K）不需要自建推理——优先用好 Batch API 和路由策略。月支出超过</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）不需要自建推理</span><span class=\"mord\">——</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">优先用好</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">和路由策略。月支出超过</span></span></span></span></span>50K 且流量稳定时，再认真评估自建的 TCO。</p>\n</blockquote>\n"}